  "description": "A modern, lightweight .NET library that provides typed, asynchronous access to the browser's localStorage and sessionStorage APIs for Blazor WebAssembly and client-side render modes. Features include result-based reads with StorageResult, key prefix namespacing, bulk operations, change notifications, configurable JSON serialization, and flexible service lifetimes.",
